  "video_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1",
  "account": "林睿读书&书在橱窗",
  "source_title": "朱棣留下影响后世六百年的大工程。一座为母亲建的琉璃宝塔，一座敬天法祖的北京天坛，一座撑起海上帝国的龙江宝船厂，一片尊崇道统的武当山宫观，一道守国门的明长城。一桩比一桩大#朱棣#永乐大帝 #明朝历史#历史科普 #中国古建筑",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 388.40093,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "咱们脚下这片土地上，曾经有这么一位皇帝，他在位的二十二年里干成了十件大事。其中，有的工程动用上百万人力，花十几年才修完。有的巨著三亿七千万字全是人手一笔一画抄出来的。还有的船队，两百多艘船，两万七千多人，比哥伦布早了。八十七年出海。有人说他劳民人伤财，有人说他功盖千秋，可不管怎么说，他留下的这些东西，六百年后的今天咱们还在看，还在用还在讲。今天咱们就来盘点盘点朱棣在位期间影响后世的十大功程。老规矩，开讲之前，劳烦您顺手扣个一点颗红心，让我看看都是谁。在听老十名南京大报恩寺与琉璃宝塔在江苏南京。朱棣为了纪念他的生母，下令修建大报恩寺。市里的核心是一座琉璃宝塔，这塔有多高？九层八面通高将近八十米，相当于二十多层楼。全塔用五色琉璃砖砌成，白瓷砖上还刻着佛像，塔上挂着一百五十二个风铃。一到晚上，塔里点上一百四十六盏，油灯灯火通明，整座塔像一座登山，当时就被西方人叫做南京磁塔，还被列为中世纪世界七大建筑奇迹之一。可惜一八五六年，这座塔毁于战火，可就算塔没了，他的名字还在历史里晾着第九名。北京天坛在北京市东城区天坛始建于永乐十八年。公元一四二零年，跟紫禁城是同时期修的那时候还不叫天坛，叫天。地坛，何似天地是朱棣迁都北京以后专门用来祭天的场所。整个建筑群占地两百七十三公顷，是故宫的三倍多。祁年殿三层，蓝色琉璃瓦顶，圆形攒间，鼎没用一根铁钉全靠榫卯。凡此丘坛、三层汉白玉圆坛，连台阶数目都是九的倍数。一个天坛把中国人对天的理解全刻在了建筑里。皇帝每年冬至来这儿祭天，祈求风调雨顺。一座天坛是中国人敬天伐祖的物证。第八名。南京龙江宝船厂与郑和宝船建造在江苏南京，这是当时全世界最大的造船基地。厂区面积将近四千亩，东西宽五百多米，南北长两公里。郑和首航用的两百零八艘船全是从这儿造出来，里面最大的宝船长四十四丈宽十八丈，宽，算下来将近一百四十米，长六十米宽，排水量上千吨，是当时世界上最大的木帆船。这个记录一直保持到十九世纪末，哥伦布的船跟他比就是条小k板。朱棣为什么能派郑和七下西洋底气？就在这儿船厂里，上万名工匠日夜不停的造一座船厂，撑起了一个海上帝国。第七名嗯武当山古建筑群在湖北十堰朱棣从永乐十年开始，派了五百多名官员率领二十万军民工匠上武当山干什么？修道教公观，整整修了十二年，建成了九宫九关三十六安堂七十二眼庙，一共三十三组建筑群。最绝的是经典，在天柱峰顶上，朱棣下令，山体本身一点都不能动，墙要顺着山势修。金殿是一座铜住的建筑，也是中国现存最大的铜筑建筑物。北京修子禁城、武当修金顶，一南一北，遥相呼应。第六名，明长城朱棣，迁都北京以后，北京紧挨着边境。蒙古骑兵随时可能南下怎么办？修长城永乐年间，朱棣在北方大规模修筑长城，把土墙改成砖石墙，加高加厚，从鸭绿江一直修到嘉峪关，整个明长城全长八千八百多公里。朱棣时期修的长城，是明长城里最关键的一段后人，说天子守国门就是从朱棣迁都北京大修长城开始的这五件事，一庄比一庄大大报恩寺的琉璃塔是朱棣对母亲的念想，天坛是对天地的敬畏，龙江宝船厂是向海的雄心，武当山是对道统的尊崇，明长城是对北方的防线。可这些还不是最震撼的。接下来第五道第一有五个功程，一个比一个惊天动地，有一支船队，两百多艘船，两万七千多人，比哥伦布早了。八十七年出海。有一座陵金丝楠木的大殿，六百年了，木头还香，有一部书三亿七千万字全是手抄的，有一条河打通了南北，养活了北京城。还有一座宫殿，一百万人修了十四年，他们是哪几个下集马上更新。您先点个关注点，开头像别走丢。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00001",
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 1830,
      "text": "咱们脚下这片土地上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1990,
      "end_ms": 3810,
      "text": "曾经有这么一位皇帝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00003",
      "start_ms": 4230,
      "end_ms": 7690,
      "text": "他在位的二十二年里干成了十件大事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00004",
      "start_ms": 8109,
      "end_ms": 8510,
      "text": "其中，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00005",
      "start_ms": 8510,
      "end_ms": 11590,
      "text": "有的工程动用上百万人力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00006",
      "start_ms": 12090,
      "end_ms": 13630,
      "text": "花十几年才修完。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00007",
      "start_ms": 14170,
      "end_ms": 19610,
      "text": "有的巨著三亿七千万字全是人手一笔一画抄出来的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00008",
      "start_ms": 20330,
      "end_ms": 21410,
      "text": "还有的船队，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00009",
      "start_ms": 21950,
      "end_ms": 23030,
      "text": "两百多艘船，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00010",
      "start_ms": 23430,
      "end_ms": 24870,
      "text": "两万七千多人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00011",
      "start_ms": 25550,
      "end_ms": 26830,
      "text": "比哥伦布早了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00012",
      "start_ms": 26830,
      "end_ms": 28110,
      "text": "八十七年出海。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00013",
      "start_ms": 28650,
      "end_ms": 31540,
      "text": "有人说他劳民人伤财，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00014",
      "start_ms": 31540,
      "end_ms": 34180,
      "text": "有人说他功盖千秋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00015",
      "start_ms": 34180,
      "end_ms": 35660,
      "text": "可不管怎么说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00016",
      "start_ms": 35660,
      "end_ms": 37080,
      "text": "他留下的这些东西，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00017",
      "start_ms": 37080,
      "end_ms": 41080,
      "text": "六百年后的今天咱们还在看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00018",
      "start_ms": 41080,
      "end_ms": 44120,
      "text": "还在用还在讲。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00019",
      "start_ms": 44140,
      "end_ms": 49640,
      "text": "今天咱们就来盘点盘点朱棣在位期间影响后世的十大功程。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00020",
      "start_ms": 50620,
      "end_ms": 51260,
      "text": "老规矩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00021",
      "start_ms": 52000,
      "end_ms": 52880,
      "text": "开讲之前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00022",
      "start_ms": 53040,
      "end_ms": 55980,
      "text": "劳烦您顺手扣个一点颗红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00023",
      "start_ms": 56260,
      "end_ms": 57760,
      "text": "让我看看都是谁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00024",
      "start_ms": 57780,
      "end_ms": 64255,
      "text": "在听老十名南京大报恩寺与琉璃宝塔在江苏南京。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00025",
      "start_ms": 65100,
      "end_ms": 66855,
      "text": "朱棣为了纪念他的生母，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00026",
      "start_ms": 67130,
      "end_ms": 69405,
      "text": "下令修建大报恩寺。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00027",
      "start_ms": 70100,
      "end_ms": 72745,
      "text": "市里的核心是一座琉璃宝塔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00028",
      "start_ms": 73080,
      "end_ms": 74065,
      "text": "这塔有多高？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00029",
      "start_ms": 74570,
      "end_ms": 77195,
      "text": "九层八面通高将近八十米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00030",
      "start_ms": 77460,
      "end_ms": 79155,
      "text": "相当于二十多层楼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00031",
      "start_ms": 79950,
      "end_ms": 82545,
      "text": "全塔用五色琉璃砖砌成，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00032",
      "start_ms": 83350,
      "end_ms": 85145,
      "text": "白瓷砖上还刻着佛像，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00033",
      "start_ms": 85760,
      "end_ms": 88415,
      "text": "塔上挂着一百五十二个风铃。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00034",
      "start_ms": 89350,
      "end_ms": 90295,
      "text": "一到晚上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00035",
      "start_ms": 90790,
      "end_ms": 93210,
      "text": "塔里点上一百四十六盏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00036",
      "start_ms": 93230,
      "end_ms": 95145,
      "text": "油灯灯火通明，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00037",
      "start_ms": 95580,
      "end_ms": 97715,
      "text": "整座塔像一座登山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00038",
      "start_ms": 98390,
      "end_ms": 101290,
      "text": "当时就被西方人叫做南京磁塔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00039",
      "start_ms": 101550,
      "end_ms": 105245,
      "text": "还被列为中世纪世界七大建筑奇迹之一。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00040",
      "start_ms": 105910,
      "end_ms": 107825,
      "text": "可惜一八五六年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00041",
      "start_ms": 108260,
      "end_ms": 110205,
      "text": "这座塔毁于战火，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00042",
      "start_ms": 110970,
      "end_ms": 112185,
      "text": "可就算塔没了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00043",
      "start_ms": 112740,
      "end_ms": 115805,
      "text": "他的名字还在历史里晾着第九名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00044",
      "start_ms": 116150,
      "end_ms": 122810,
      "text": "北京天坛在北京市东城区天坛始建于永乐十八年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00045",
      "start_ms": 123030,
      "end_ms": 124790,
      "text": "公元一四二零年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00046",
      "start_ms": 125470,
      "end_ms": 129510,
      "text": "跟紫禁城是同时期修的那时候还不叫天坛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00047",
      "start_ms": 129970,
      "end_ms": 130670,
      "text": "叫天。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00048",
      "start_ms": 130770,
      "end_ms": 131370,
      "text": "地坛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00049",
      "start_ms": 131810,
      "end_ms": 138010,
      "text": "何似天地是朱棣迁都北京以后专门用来祭天的场所。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00050",
      "start_ms": 138410,
      "end_ms": 142150,
      "text": "整个建筑群占地两百七十三公顷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00051",
      "start_ms": 142830,
      "end_ms": 144470,
      "text": "是故宫的三倍多。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00052",
      "start_ms": 145090,
      "end_ms": 146870,
      "text": "祁年殿三层，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00053",
      "start_ms": 147050,
      "end_ms": 148310,
      "text": "蓝色琉璃瓦顶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00054",
      "start_ms": 148670,
      "end_ms": 149590,
      "text": "圆形攒间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00055",
      "start_ms": 149590,
      "end_ms": 153000,
      "text": "鼎没用一根铁钉全靠榫卯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00056",
      "start_ms": 153340,
      "end_ms": 156240,
      "text": "凡此丘坛、三层汉白玉圆坛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00057",
      "start_ms": 156440,
      "end_ms": 158680,
      "text": "连台阶数目都是九的倍数。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00058",
      "start_ms": 158980,
      "end_ms": 163880,
      "text": "一个天坛把中国人对天的理解全刻在了建筑里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00059",
      "start_ms": 164640,
      "end_ms": 166940,
      "text": "皇帝每年冬至来这儿祭天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00060",
      "start_ms": 167500,
      "end_ms": 168920,
      "text": "祈求风调雨顺。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00061",
      "start_ms": 169460,
      "end_ms": 173340,
      "text": "一座天坛是中国人敬天伐祖的物证。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00062",
      "start_ms": 174300,
      "end_ms": 175020,
      "text": "第八名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00063",
      "start_ms": 175320,
      "end_ms": 180510,
      "text": "南京龙江宝船厂与郑和宝船建造在江苏南京，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00064",
      "start_ms": 180990,
      "end_ms": 183970,
      "text": "这是当时全世界最大的造船基地。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00065",
      "start_ms": 184570,
      "end_ms": 187370,
      "text": "厂区面积将近四千亩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00066",
      "start_ms": 188109,
      "end_ms": 190190,
      "text": "东西宽五百多米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00067",
      "start_ms": 190870,
      "end_ms": 192290,
      "text": "南北长两公里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00068",
      "start_ms": 193030,
      "end_ms": 198030,
      "text": "郑和首航用的两百零八艘船全是从这儿造出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00069",
      "start_ms": 199110,
      "end_ms": 204850,
      "text": "里面最大的宝船长四十四丈宽十八丈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00070",
      "start_ms": 205710,
      "end_ms": 205950,
      "text": "宽，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00071",
      "start_ms": 205990,
      "end_ms": 209110,
      "text": "算下来将近一百四十米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00072",
      "start_ms": 209110,
      "end_ms": 211280,
      "text": "长六十米宽，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00073",
      "start_ms": 212160,
      "end_ms": 214020,
      "text": "排水量上千吨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00074",
      "start_ms": 214560,
      "end_ms": 217680,
      "text": "是当时世界上最大的木帆船。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00075",
      "start_ms": 218300,
      "end_ms": 221620,
      "text": "这个记录一直保持到十九世纪末，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00076",
      "start_ms": 222180,
      "end_ms": 225680,
      "text": "哥伦布的船跟他比就是条小k板。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00077",
      "start_ms": 226160,
      "end_ms": 230180,
      "text": "朱棣为什么能派郑和七下西洋底气？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00078",
      "start_ms": 230260,
      "end_ms": 232620,
      "text": "就在这儿船厂里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00079",
      "start_ms": 232620,
      "end_ms": 237060,
      "text": "上万名工匠日夜不停的造一座船厂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00080",
      "start_ms": 237360,
      "end_ms": 239280,
      "text": "撑起了一个海上帝国。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00081",
      "start_ms": 239440,
      "end_ms": 247105,
      "text": "第七名嗯武当山古建筑群在湖北十堰朱棣从永乐十年开始，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00082",
      "start_ms": 247560,
      "end_ms": 253155,
      "text": "派了五百多名官员率领二十万军民工匠上武当山干什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00083",
      "start_ms": 253520,
      "end_ms": 254635,
      "text": "修道教公观，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00084",
      "start_ms": 254910,
      "end_ms": 256185,
      "text": "整整修了十二年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00085",
      "start_ms": 256460,
      "end_ms": 261075,
      "text": "建成了九宫九关三十六安堂七十二眼庙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00086",
      "start_ms": 261870,
      "end_ms": 263785,
      "text": "一共三十三组建筑群。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00087",
      "start_ms": 264180,
      "end_ms": 265425,
      "text": "最绝的是经典，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00088",
      "start_ms": 265730,
      "end_ms": 267145,
      "text": "在天柱峰顶上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00089",
      "start_ms": 267800,
      "end_ms": 268525,
      "text": "朱棣下令，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00090",
      "start_ms": 268990,
      "end_ms": 271205,
      "text": "山体本身一点都不能动，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00091",
      "start_ms": 271860,
      "end_ms": 273445,
      "text": "墙要顺着山势修。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00092",
      "start_ms": 273980,
      "end_ms": 276100,
      "text": "金殿是一座铜住的建筑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00093",
      "start_ms": 276240,
      "end_ms": 279535,
      "text": "也是中国现存最大的铜筑建筑物。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00094",
      "start_ms": 280050,
      "end_ms": 283635,
      "text": "北京修子禁城、武当修金顶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00095",
      "start_ms": 283970,
      "end_ms": 284810,
      "text": "一南一北，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00096",
      "start_ms": 285050,
      "end_ms": 286115,
      "text": "遥相呼应。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00097",
      "start_ms": 287200,
      "end_ms": 287745,
      "text": "第六名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00098",
      "start_ms": 288030,
      "end_ms": 290310,
      "text": "明长城朱棣，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00099",
      "start_ms": 290370,
      "end_ms": 291685,
      "text": "迁都北京以后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00100",
      "start_ms": 292180,
      "end_ms": 293715,
      "text": "北京紧挨着边境。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00101",
      "start_ms": 294280,
      "end_ms": 297600,
      "text": "蒙古骑兵随时可能南下怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00102",
      "start_ms": 298420,
      "end_ms": 300240,
      "text": "修长城永乐年间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00103",
      "start_ms": 300720,
      "end_ms": 303700,
      "text": "朱棣在北方大规模修筑长城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00104",
      "start_ms": 304120,
      "end_ms": 306340,
      "text": "把土墙改成砖石墙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00105",
      "start_ms": 307020,
      "end_ms": 308200,
      "text": "加高加厚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00106",
      "start_ms": 308560,
      "end_ms": 310820,
      "text": "从鸭绿江一直修到嘉峪关，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00107",
      "start_ms": 311080,
      "end_ms": 314900,
      "text": "整个明长城全长八千八百多公里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00108",
      "start_ms": 315800,
      "end_ms": 317300,
      "text": "朱棣时期修的长城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00109",
      "start_ms": 317420,
      "end_ms": 320580,
      "text": "是明长城里最关键的一段后人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00110",
      "start_ms": 320580,
      "end_ms": 328150,
      "text": "说天子守国门就是从朱棣迁都北京大修长城开始的这五件事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00111",
      "start_ms": 328590,
      "end_ms": 335390,
      "text": "一庄比一庄大大报恩寺的琉璃塔是朱棣对母亲的念想，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00112",
      "start_ms": 335430,
      "end_ms": 338030,
      "text": "天坛是对天地的敬畏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00113",
      "start_ms": 338810,
      "end_ms": 341430,
      "text": "龙江宝船厂是向海的雄心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00114",
      "start_ms": 341830,
      "end_ms": 344130,
      "text": "武当山是对道统的尊崇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00115",
      "start_ms": 344610,
      "end_ms": 347170,
      "text": "明长城是对北方的防线。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00116",
      "start_ms": 347710,
      "end_ms": 350050,
      "text": "可这些还不是最震撼的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00117",
      "start_ms": 350710,
      "end_ms": 353585,
      "text": "接下来第五道第一有五个功程，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00118",
      "start_ms": 354040,
      "end_ms": 355840,
      "text": "一个比一个惊天动地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00119",
      "start_ms": 355960,
      "end_ms": 357045,
      "text": "有一支船队，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00120",
      "start_ms": 357400,
      "end_ms": 358395,
      "text": "两百多艘船，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00121",
      "start_ms": 358690,
      "end_ms": 359855,
      "text": "两万七千多人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00122",
      "start_ms": 360180,
      "end_ms": 361120,
      "text": "比哥伦布早了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00123",
      "start_ms": 361120,
      "end_ms": 362315,
      "text": "八十七年出海。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00124",
      "start_ms": 363130,
      "end_ms": 366055,
      "text": "有一座陵金丝楠木的大殿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00125",
      "start_ms": 366480,
      "end_ms": 367280,
      "text": "六百年了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00126",
      "start_ms": 367280,
      "end_ms": 368135,
      "text": "木头还香，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00127",
      "start_ms": 368660,
      "end_ms": 373225,
      "text": "有一部书三亿七千万字全是手抄的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00128",
      "start_ms": 373690,
      "end_ms": 375965,
      "text": "有一条河打通了南北，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00129",
      "start_ms": 376230,
      "end_ms": 377415,
      "text": "养活了北京城。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00130",
      "start_ms": 377930,
      "end_ms": 379215,
      "text": "还有一座宫殿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00131",
      "start_ms": 379550,
      "end_ms": 381445,
      "text": "一百万人修了十四年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00132",
      "start_ms": 381930,
      "end_ms": 384575,
      "text": "他们是哪几个下集马上更新。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00133",
      "start_ms": 384990,
      "end_ms": 386800,
      "text": "您先点个关注点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1f708899e25bcbd1_s00134",
      "start_ms": 386800,
      "end_ms": 388275,
      "text": "开头像别走丢。"
    }
  ],
